      "pot": {
        "content": "```python\ndef solution():\n    # Define variables name and value\n    coupon_rate = 0.03\n    market_rate = 0.05\n    years_to_maturity = 3\n    par_value = 100\n    payments_per_year = 2\n\n    # Do math calculation to get the answer\n    period_rate = market_rate / payments_per_year\n    coupon_payment = par_value * coupon_rate / payments_per_year\n    total_periods = years_to_maturity * payments_per_year\n\n    bond_price = sum(\n        coupon_payment / (1 + period_rate) ** period\n        for period in range(1, total_periods + 1)\n    ) + par_value / (1 + period_rate) ** total_periods\n\n    # Return answer rounded to three decimal places\n    return round(bond_price, 3)\n```",
